type: software
title: "canopy-growth: Canopy Growth from Repeated Airborne LiDAR"
abstract: >-
  Canopy height growth in m/yr with an interval, measured from the repeated
  national airborne LiDAR surveys of Spain (PNOA), with a passport of every
  survey strip and a report on where the numbers can be trusted.
